    "created_at": "2017-01-26T13:22:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-26T13:22:25Z",
    "body": "I think the space is what makes us inconsistent with the ISO standard for dates and also JavaScript. See also https://mail.mozilla.org/pipermail/es-discuss/2013-April/030207.html.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
